{"2406680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kromlech", "steam_appid": 2406680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of iron and blood, warrior!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kromlech is a single player action-adventure game blending RPG, immersive sim, and rogue-lite. A love letter to the immersive RPGs of the early 2000s featuring modern design ideas and QoL features, while still keeping things distinctly old-school. Step into a mythical world of ancient past where steel is still young, sorcery treacherous, and the truth can only be found at the edge of a blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the cultures of the European Iron Age, predominantly the Celts, as well as the greatest works of the Sword &amp; Sorcery genre, Kromlech seeks to deliver darker and grittier kind of heroic fantasy. One where heroes are defined not by their moral virtue, but by the impact of their actions on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Cronach, a lone adventurer living through the world’s last days. Make good use of the time you have left and you may discover what is going on—and maybe even learn how to stop it, so that you can enjoy your hard-earned coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/b5a073e45d4e63dbc62c5a3fe7c028c3.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A World of Adventure</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world has been meticulously crafted by hand and offers an immersive sandbox experience with a high level of reactivity. Discover its secrets, pillage its treasures, slay its inhabitants. None are safe from your blade. Become the hero the world needs… or the menace it deserves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/323837f29123c11efde15c1470c9efa7.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many ways to customize your build and style of play. Inscribe your equipment with words of power, drink mystical brews, cover your body with warpaint, refine your feats of battle, sacrifice to the gods, and reach mastery through practice and dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/b38782fa649ce6466df1d5613d3ede3d.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Crush Your Enemies</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system offers many ways to deal with your enemies. Exploit their weaknesses with precise strikes or rip their armor to shreds. Pummel them with brute force or skillfully weave through the fray. Let the heat of battle consume you and show them the meaning of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/c897b5d31691961e6132edb833008c71.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Become a Legend</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow more powerful by overcoming challenges and gaining renown. Perform heroic deeds, defeat perilous foes, and embark on epic quests. Your triumphs shall earn you new epithets—heroic names of great power. But beware, for fame is a sword that cuts both ways.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of iron and blood, warrior!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kromlech is a single player action-adventure game blending RPG, immersive sim, and rogue-lite. A love letter to the immersive RPGs of the early 2000s featuring modern design ideas and QoL features, while still keeping things distinctly old-school. Step into a mythical world of ancient past where steel is still young, sorcery treacherous, and the truth can only be found at the edge of a blade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the cultures of the European Iron Age, predominantly the Celts, as well as the greatest works of the Sword &amp; Sorcery genre, Kromlech seeks to deliver darker and grittier kind of heroic fantasy. One where heroes are defined not by their moral virtue, but by the impact of their actions on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Cronach, a lone adventurer living through the world’s last days. Make good use of the time you have left and you may discover what is going on—and maybe even learn how to stop it, so that you can enjoy your hard-earned coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Key Features</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/b5a073e45d4e63dbc62c5a3fe7c028c3.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A World of Adventure</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game world has been meticulously crafted by hand and offers an immersive sandbox experience with a high level of reactivity. Discover its secrets, pillage its treasures, slay its inhabitants. None are safe from your blade. Become the hero the world needs… or the menace it deserves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/323837f29123c11efde15c1470c9efa7.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many ways to customize your build and style of play. Inscribe your equipment with words of power, drink mystical brews, cover your body with warpaint, refine your feats of battle, sacrifice to the gods, and reach mastery through practice and dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/b38782fa649ce6466df1d5613d3ede3d.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Crush Your Enemies</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system offers many ways to deal with your enemies. Exploit their weaknesses with precise strikes or rip their armor to shreds. Pummel them with brute force or skillfully weave through the fray. Let the heat of battle consume you and show them the meaning of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/extras/c897b5d31691961e6132edb833008c71.avif?t=1779722703\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Become a Legend</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow more powerful by overcoming challenges and gaining renown. Perform heroic deeds, defeat perilous foes, and embark on epic quests. Your triumphs shall earn you new epithets—heroic names of great power. But beware, for fame is a sword that cuts both ways.</p>", "short_description": "Kromlech is an action-adventure RPG with rogue-lite elements, set in a dark fantasy world of swords and sorcery. Play as an adventurer whose quest for glory and gold takes an unexpected turn when he finds himself at the center of a world-ending calamity.", "supported_languages": "English, Czech, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/21453c9fd0e7d0165c3a54013e7be5f4e4883e5f/header.jpg?t=1779722703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/d738c2c9400741c020e10891df49bc184bbfecb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779722703", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406680/d738c2c9400741c020e10891df49bc184bbfecb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779722703", "website": "https://kromlechgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600 / AMD RYZEN 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2060 (8GB) / AMD RX 6600 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> HDD Supported, SSD Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-11500 / AMD RYZEN 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 2080 TI / AMD RX 6800 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB avail